  "designNotes": [
    "Ground Floor features South facing entry with half-width single car parking bay.",
    "Kitchen located in South-East corner and Pooja in North-East direction as per Vastu guidelines.",
    "Staircase and wet plumbing stacks (Toilets 1, 2, store, and ventilation duct) strictly vertically aligned across Ground, First, and Second floors.",
    "Master Bedroom placed on First Floor with direct attached toilet.",
    "Second floor offers a versatile multipurpose room along with extensive open-air terrace spaces."
